        "doi:aff130c76e68ead3862e#label": "Generalized linear mixed model with probability of flea beetle incidence as the response variable, and the following fixed effects: varietal richness; the percent of agriculture within a 1,000 m radius; the number of varietal colors; the interaction between varietal richness and number of varietal colors; and the interaction between varietal richness and the percent of agriculture."
      },
